  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1803,
      "text": "Alif Lām Ra[1]. These are the verses of the Book and a clear Qur’an.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1804,
      "text": "The disbelievers will soon[2] wish that they were Muslims.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1805,
      "text": "Let them eat and enjoy themselves and be diverted with false hope; they will come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1806,
      "text": "We never destroyed any town except that it had a destined time.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1807,
      "text": "No nation can advance its appointed time, nor can they delay it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1808,
      "text": "They say, “O you to whom the Reminder has been sent down, You are surely insane[3]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1809,
      "text": "Why do you not bring us the angels, if you are truthful?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1810,
      "text": "We do not send down the angels except for a just cause, and then [the disbelievers] would be granted no respite[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1811,
      "text": "It is We Who have sent down the Reminder[5], and it is We Who will preserve it[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1812,
      "text": "We did send messengers before you among the factions of early peoples.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1813,
      "text": "No messenger came to them except that they ridiculed him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1814,
      "text": "This is how We let this [denial] enter the hearts of the wicked[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1815,
      "text": "They will not believe in it, although the examples of the earlier people are well established.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1816,
      "text": "Even if We were to open for them a gateway to the heaven, through which they kept ascending,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 262,
      "ruku": 218,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1817,
      "text": "they would still say, “Our eyes have been dazzled; rather, we have been bewitched.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
